  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 701.06 When Submitted. Unless otherwise provided in these rules, any fee prescribed by a statute or rule shall be submitted for the full amount due as calculated by Liq 703.06 at the same time as the application to which it applies.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Liq 700) #13114, eff 9-25-20",
